-- =============================================================================
-- TechBio final pass: EU grants, court notices, tax-credit approvals, trials
-- =============================================================================
-- legacy_source 'techbio_final_pass_november_2026'.
-- 1) EU grants (Horizon 2020 / Horizon Europe incl. EIC) from scanR project
--    records (CORDIS data): the company's own share per project. 44 grants,
--    €31.2M to 15 companies. Projects where the company's share is 0
--    or unrecorded (e.g. Ksilink's 2024 EIC Accelerator selection, Iktos's
--    first AIR-3D entry) are not loaded.
-- 2) BODACC court notices, checked by SIREN (via Pappers, 9 Nov 2026):
--    Iktos receivership 6 Oct 2026; Ariana Pharmaceuticals receivership
--    8 Sep 2026; Poietis receivership 9 Jul 2024, sale plan 21 Jan 2025,
--    liquidation 22 Jan 2025 (status -> inactive).
-- 3) Research tax credit (CIR) / innovation tax credit (CII) approvals, from
--    the research ministry's lists of approved bodies, stored as tags.
-- 4) ClinicalTrials.gov: Cure51 (NCT06160596) and Owkin (NCT06625203), both
--    observational studies, stored as events.
-- =============================================================================
