roject budget €7,136,104. Source: scanR (MESR) project records, from CORDIS.", "url": "https://cordis.europa.eu/project/id/101057651"}, {"org": "ai-biopharma", "name": "Horizon 2020 – CARE (Research and Innovation action)", "body": "European Commission (Horizon 2020)", "amt": 112250.0, "prog": "Horizon 2020 · Research and Innovation actions · H2020-JTI-IMI2-2020-21-single-stage (2020)", "desc": "EU share for the company in project CARE: Corona Accelerated R&D in Europe. Call H2020-JTI-IMI2-2020-21-single-stage, 2020. Total project budget €75,906,676. Source: scanR (MESR) project records, from CORDIS.", "url": "https://cordis.europa.eu/project/id/101005077"}, {"org": "deeplife", "name": "Horizon Europe – TAME (Marie Skłodowska-Curie)", "body": "European Commission (Horizon Europe)", "amt": 282693.6, "prog": "Horizon Europe · Marie Skłodowska-Curie actions · HORIZON-MSCA-2022-DN-01 (2022)", "desc": "EU share for the company in project TAME: Doctoral training network TAu imMunE: strategies for innovative diagnosis and therapies in dementia. Call HORIZON-MSCA-2022-DN-01, 2022. Total project budget €2,673,698. Source: scanR (MESR) project records, from CORDIS.", "url": "https://cordis.europa.eu/project/id/101119596"}, {"org": "deeplife", "name": "Horizon Europe – spaXio (Marie Skłodowska-Curie)", "body": "European Commission (Horizon Europe)", "amt": 419558.88, "prog": "Horizon Europe · Marie Skłodowska-Curie actions · HORIZON-MSCA-2024-DN-01 (2024)", "desc": "EU share for the company in project spaXio: Spatial Crosstalk in Immuno-Oncology. Call HORIZON-MSCA-2024-DN-01, 2024. Total project budget €4,573,029. Source: scanR (MESR) project records, from CORDIS.", "url": "https://cordis.europa.eu/project/id/101226364"}, {"org": "peaccel", "name": "Horizon Europe – ELEGANCE (Marie Skłodowska-Curie)", "body": "European Commission (Horizon Europe)", "amt": 314669.16, "prog": "Horizon Europe · Marie Skłodowska-Curie actions · HORIZON-MSCA-2024-DN-01 (2024)", "desc": "EU share for the company in project ELEGANCE: Machine learning for integrated multi-parametric enzyme and bioprocess design. Call HORIZON-MSCA-2024-DN-01, 2024. Total project budget €4,726,338. Source: scanR (MESR) project records, from CORDIS.", "url": "https://cordis.europa.eu/project/id/101226960"}]$j$) AS (org text, name text, body text, amt numeric, prog text, "desc" text, url text))
INSERT INTO grants (id, organization_id, grant_name, granting_body, amount_eur, awarded_date, program, description, source_url, created_at, updated_at)
SELECT uuid_generate_v4(), o.id, s.name, s.body, s.amt, NULL, s.prog, s."desc", s.url, NOW(), NOW()
FROM s JOIN organizations o ON o.slug=s.org
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM grants g WHERE g.organization_id=o.id AND g.grant_name=s.name);

UPDATE organizations SET status='inactive'::organization_status,
  description=description||' In judicial liquidation since 22 January 2025, after the Bordeaux court approved a sale plan for its business.', updated_at=NOW()
WHERE slug='poietis' AND description NOT LIKE '%judicial liquidation since 22 January 2025%';

INSERT INTO organization_events (id, organization_id, event_type, event_date, title, description, source_url, source_type, source_name, verification_status, legacy_source, created_at, updated_at)
SELECT uuid_generate_v4(), o.id, e.t::event_type, e.d::date, e.title, e.descr, e.url, e.st, e.sn, 'high', 'techbio_final_pass_november_2026', NOW(), NOW()
FROM (VALUES
 ('iktos','other','2026-10-06','Iktos placed in receivership (redressement judiciaire)','Paris economic-activities court opened receivership proceedings on 6 October 2026; cessation of payments dated 18 September 2026. Administrator SCP Abitbol & Rousselet (Me Joanna Rousselet); creditors'' representative SCP BTSG (Me Antoine Barti). BODACC A n°20260203, annonce 4982, 22 October 2026.','https://www.bodacc.fr/annonce/detail-annonce/A/20260203/4982','official_gazette','BODACC'),
 ('ariana-pharmaceuticals','other','2026-09-08','Ariana Pharmaceuticals placed in receivership (redressement judiciaire)','Paris economic-activities court opened receivership proceedings on 8 September 2026 (case P202603246); cessation of payments dated 31 July 2026; observation period to 8 March 2027. Administrator Selarlu Ascagne AJ (Me Julie Lavoir); creditors'' representative Selafa MJA (Me Florian Lacour). BODACC A n°20260183, annonce 1617, 24 September 2026.','https://www.bodacc.fr/annonce/detail-annonce/A/20260183/1617','official_gazette','BODACC'),
 ('poietis','other','2024-07-09','Poietis placed in receivership (redressement judiciaire)','Bordeaux court opened receivership proceedings on 9 July 2024; cessation of payments dated 28 June 2024. BODACC A n°20240139, annonce 2540, 19 July 2024.','https://www.bodacc.fr/annonce/detail-annonce/A/20240139/2540','official_gazette','BODACC'),
 ('poietis','acquisition','2025-01-21','Court approves sale plan for Poietis''s business','Bordeaux court approved a sale plan (plan de cession) on 21 January 2025; the buyer is not named in the notice. BODACC A n°20250022, annonce 2255, 31 January 2025.','https://www.bodacc.fr/annonce/detail-annonce/A/20250022/2255','official_gazette','BODACC'),
 ('poietis','shutdown','2025-01-22','Poietis placed in judicial liquidation','Bordeaux court converted the receivership into judicial liquidation on 22 January 2025; liquidator Me Jacques De Latude. The company is still listed on the register. BODACC A n°20250022, annonce 2251, 31 January 2025.','https://www.bodacc.fr/annonce/detail-annonce/A/20250022/2251','official_gazette','BODACC'),
 ('cure51','other','2023-11-01','Cure51 sponsors observational study NCT06160596','Lead sponsor of "Analyzing and Solving Exceptional Long-term Survivors in Solid Tumors With Poor Prognosis" (observational, recruiting), with Gustave Roussy, Centre Léon Bérard, Vall d''Hebron Institute of Oncology, Istituto Europeo di Oncologia and Charité Berlin. Conditions: pancreatic adenocarcinoma, small-cell lung cancer, glioblastoma.','https://clinicaltrials.gov/study/NCT06160596','registry','ClinicalTrials.gov'),
 ('owkin','other','2023-05-08','Owkin sponsors observational study NCT06625203','Lead sponsor of a non-interventional, international multicentre study to build a large multimodal oncology dataset (clinical, imaging and omics data); status active, not recruiting. Conditions: diffuse large B-cell lymphoma, solid tumours.','https://clinicaltrials.gov/study/NCT06625203','registry','ClinicalTrials.gov')
) e(slug,t,d,title,descr,url,st,sn)
JOIN organizations o ON o.slug=e.slug
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM organization_events x WHERE x.organization_id=o.id AND x.title=e.title);

INSERT INTO organization_tags (id, organization_id, tag, created_at)
SELECT uuid_generate_v4(), o.id, t.tag, NOW()
FROM (VALUES
 ('ksilink','CIR-approved research body (2023–2025)'),
 ('ariana-pharmaceuticals','CIR-approved research body (2010–2012, 2025–2027)'),
 ('parean-biotechnologies','CIR-approved research body (2021–2023, 2024–2026)'),
 ('qubit-pharmaceuticals','CIR-approved research body (2021–2023)'),
 ('medinsights','CIR-approved research body (2025–2027)'),
 ('medinsights','CII-approved innovation body (2025–2027)'),
 ('ai-biopharma','CIR-approved research body (2018–2020)'),
 ('poietis','CIR-approved research body (2015–2017, 2018–2019)'),
 ('insilibio','CIR-approved research body (2025–2027)'),
 ('insilibio','CII-approved innovation body (2025–2027)'),
 ('iktos','CIR-approved research body (2018–2020)'),
 ('netri','CIR-approved research body (2023–2025)')
) t(slug,tag) JOIN organizations o ON o.slug=t.slug
ON CONFLICT (organization_id, tag) DO NOTHING;

SELECT (SELECT count(*) FROM grants WHERE granting_body LIKE 'European Commission%') eu_grants,
 (SELECT round(sum(amount_eur)/1e6,2) FROM grants WHERE granting_body LIKE 'European Commission%') eu_total,
 (SELECT count(*) FROM organization_events WHERE legacy_source='techbio_final_pass_november_2026') events,
 (SELECT count(*) FROM organization_tags WHERE tag LIKE 'CI_-approved%') tags,
 (SELECT status FROM organizations WHERE slug='poietis') poietis;
